.Dd May 19, 2026
.Dt MACSCOPE 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm macscope
.Nd macOS introspection and triage toolkit
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Cm help
.Nm
.Cm version
.Op Fl -json
.Nm
.Cm macho
.Op Fl -json
.Op Fl -full
.Op Fl -triage
.Ar path
.Nm
.Cm proc
.Op Fl -json
.Ar pid-or-name
.Nm
.Cm attach
.Op Fl -json
.Op Fl -last Ar duration
.Ar pid
.Nm
.Cm persist
.Op Fl -json
.Op Fl -dir Ar launchd-dir
.Nm
.Cm tcc
.Op Fl -json
.Op Fl -last Ar duration
.Nm
.Cm tcc
.Fl -watch
.Nm
.Cm es
.Op Fl -json
.Op Fl -last Ar duration
.Nm
.Cm es
.Fl -watch
.Nm
.Cm vpn
.Op Fl -json
.Op Fl -last Ar duration
.Op Ar vpn-name
.Nm
.Cm panic
.Fl -last
.Op Fl -json
.Nm
.Cm panic
.Fl -file Ar panic-file
.Op Fl -json
.Nm
.Cm panic
.Fl -since Ar duration
.Op Fl -json
.Nm
.Cm timeline
.Fl -pid Ar pid
.Op Fl -last Ar duration
.Op Fl -json | Fl -jsonl
.Nm
.Cm sysext
.Op Fl -json
.Nm
.Cm completion
.Ar bash | zsh | fish
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is a read-only macOS diagnostics CLI for process, binary, signing,
policy, panic, persistence, VPN, and unified-log triage.
It is designed for defensive introspection and evidence-driven output.
.Pp
.Nm
does not bypass SIP, AMFI, TCC, Gatekeeper, taskgated, EndpointSecurity,
or hardened runtime policy.
It reports observed evidence and next checks rather than modifying system
security state.
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Cm version Op Fl -json
Show build version, commit, build date, Go version, and target platform.
.It Cm macho Op Fl -json Op Fl -full Op Fl -triage Ar path
Inspect a Mach-O binary or app bundle.
The command reports file identity, architectures, signing, Gatekeeper
assessment, extended attributes, linked libraries, and evidence-backed
findings.
.Fl -triage
flag prints a compact 0-100 score with signals and next actions.
.It Cm proc Op Fl -json Ar pid-or-name
Resolve a running process using native process tools, summarize identity
fields, and check executable signing when a path is available.
.It Cm attach Op Fl -json Op Fl -last Ar duration Ar pid
Explain likely LLDB attach failures using process identity, developer group
membership, signing state, and recent attach-relevant unified logs.
.It Cm persist Op Fl -json Op Fl -dir Ar launchd-dir
Inspect launchd LaunchAgent and LaunchDaemon plists and score suspicious
persistence traits with explicit evidence.
.It Cm tcc Op Fl -json Op Fl -last Ar duration
Parse recent unified logs for TCC and privacy denial evidence.
.It Cm tcc Fl -watch
Stream matching TCC/privacy logs.
.It Cm es Op Fl -json Op Fl -last Ar duration
Parse recent EndpointSecurity entitlement and access-denial logs.
.It Cm es Fl -watch
Stream matching EndpointSecurity logs.
.It Cm vpn Op Fl -json Op Fl -last Ar duration Op Ar vpn-name
Collect VPN service state, utun interfaces, DNS, proxy, route, recent log,
and sleep/wake evidence.
.It Cm panic Fl -last Op Fl -json
Parse the newest panic report under
.Pa /Library/Logs/DiagnosticReports .
.It Cm panic Fl -file Ar panic-file Op Fl -json
Parse a specific panic report.
.It Cm panic Fl -since Ar duration Op Fl -json
Parse panic reports modified within a Go-style duration such as
.Ql 30m
or
.Ql 48h .
.It Cm timeline Fl -pid Ar pid Op Fl -last Ar duration Op Fl -json | Fl -jsonl
Correlate process identity, signing state, and attach/policy-related log
events into normalized timeline events.
.It Cm sysext Op Fl -json
Inventory installed system extensions using
.Xr systemextensionsctl 8
and classify notable states such as multiple active network extensions,
extensions awaiting user approval, and terminated extensions.
.It Cm completion Ar bash | zsh | fish
Generate shell completion scripts.
.El
.Sh OUTPUT
Human output is concise and evidence-driven.
Commands that produce structured reports support
.Fl -json
where noted.
.Cm timeline
command also supports
.Fl -jsonl
for one normalized event per line.
.Pp
Set
.Ev NO_COLOR=1
or
.Ev MACSCOPE_NO_COLOR=1
to disable ANSI styling in human output.
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ev NO_COLOR
Disable ANSI color when set to any value.
.It Ev MACSCOPE_NO_COLOR
Disable ANSI color when set to any value.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa /Library/Logs/DiagnosticReports/*.panic
Default panic report search path.
.It Pa /Library/LaunchAgents
Default launchd persistence search path.
.It Pa /Library/LaunchDaemons
Default launchd persistence search path.
.It Pa ~/Library/LaunchAgents
Default per-user launchd persistence search path.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Pp
.Nm
returns 2 for command-line usage errors and unknown commands.
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
macscope macho --triage /bin/ls
macscope panic --file testdata/panic/watchdog.panic
macscope proc WindowServer
macscope attach 123
macscope persist --json
macscope tcc --last 30m
macscope vpn
macscope timeline --pid 123 --jsonl
macscope sysext
source <(macscope completion zsh)
.Ed
.Sh NATIVE TOOLS
.Nm
wraps supported macOS tools such as
.Nm codesign ,
.Nm file ,
.Nm ifconfig ,
.Nm lipo ,
.Nm log ,
.Nm otool ,
.Nm ps ,
.Nm scutil ,
.Nm spctl ,
and
.Nm systemextensionsctl .
